00:25:09.041 --> 00:25:11.542
Art was more therapy,
I use art in the presentations

00:25:11.542 --> 00:25:13.250
because people think it's cool.

00:25:13.250 --> 00:25:15.375
But for me, it's a
sanctuary back in my studio

00:25:15.375 --> 00:25:17.166
just to grow, but
it's also documenting,

00:25:17.166 --> 00:25:18.750
that's why I write, to document.

00:25:18.750 --> 00:25:19.959
- Blake, I think
the key is always

00:25:19.959 --> 00:25:21.291
