00:25:21.291 --> 00:25:23.625
I think the fact that we're
capable of today's technologies

00:25:23.625 --> 00:25:25.208
to document is really cool.

00:25:25.208 --> 00:25:26.583
To be very frank with you,

00:25:26.583 --> 00:25:28.208
one thing that I
also want to throw out is,

00:25:28.208 --> 00:25:28.750
I think people are

00:25:28.750 --> 00:25:31.083
underestimating 
the documentation

00:25:31.083 --> 00:25:33.417
of their lives and the
impact on their families.

00:25:33.417 --> 00:25:35.166
I would tell you, no question,

00:25:35.166 --> 00:25:37.250
the coolest thing
from documenting all this

